DESCRIPTION:Join NJA’s stewardship staff\, along with representatives from North Jersey RC&D\, USDA-NRCS\, The Xerces Society\, Ridge & Valley Conservancy and other organizations to learn about conservation options for your property! \nThe Conservation Planning Fair will be held at the Hackettstown Free Library on April 23rd from 12pm-3pm. \n  \nREGISTER FOR FREE
